# Healthcare Agents Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values

# ============================================
# Langfuse Observability (OPTIONAL)
# ============================================
# Langfuse provides observability for agent invocations, tracing, and metrics.
# If not provided, the system will deploy without observability features.
#
# Option 1: Use shared team Langfuse instance (contact team lead for credentials)
# Option 2: Create your own free account at https://cloud.langfuse.com
#
# To set up your own instance:
# 1. Sign up at https://cloud.langfuse.com
# 2. Create a new project
# 3. Go to Settings → API Keys
# 4. Copy the keys below
#
# LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=sk-lf-...
# LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk-lf-...
# LANGFUSE_BASE_URL=https://cloud.langfuse.com

# ============================================
# AWS Configuration (REQUIRED)
# ============================================
# These are configured automatically by AWS CLI profile
# No manual configuration needed - just ensure you're using the correct profile:
# export AWS_PROFILE=your-profile-name
